  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Craft (calligraphy) 1 rank, Protection sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You have learned to use ancient writings and symbols to enhance your Protection sphere abilities. When you create a ward, you gain a bonus to your caster level equal to half the number of ranks you have in the Craft (calligraphy) skill, rounded up. This can not increase your caster level above your Hit Dice.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/protection#toc117\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
